CORE
test.c
--nondet-volatile-write-model reg:observe --mmio-weak --mmio-weak-depth 3
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
MMIO write burst exceeds the modelled reorder depth.*: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
